                                "sense_id": "1cddb7da-86cd-3f14-b689-5ca0756414a8",
                                "text": "Everyone knows that feeling of walking into a room and the atmosphere being bare bookie but also calm. In this LA Beats produced track the boys reminisce on those rooms where you’re greeted by a combination of “bare weed smoke” and “wavy settings”."
